{
  "title": "{ip:Posso} entrare? {imv:Scusa}, {ip:sto} per uscire!",
  "translation": "May I come in? Sorry, I'm about to go out!",
  "topics": "potere, volere, dovere, the near future, basic commands",
  "grammar": {
    "explain": [
      "*Potere* (can, may), *volere* (want) and *dovere* (must) are followed by an infinitive: *{ip:Posso} entrare? {ip:Voglio} mangiare. {ip:Devo} studiare.*",
      {
        "table": {
          "head": [
            "",
            "potere",
            "volere",
            "dovere"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "io",
              "{ip:posso}",
              "{ip:voglio}",
              "{ip:devo}"
            ],
            [
              "tu",
              "{ip:puoi}",
              "{ip:vuoi}",
              "{ip:devi}"
            ],
            [
              "lui / lei",
              "{ip:può}",
              "{ip:vuole}",
              "{ip:deve}"
            ],
            [
              "noi",
              "{ip:possiamo}",
              "{ip:vogliamo}",
              "{ip:dobbiamo}"
            ],
            [
              "voi",
              "{ip:potete}",
              "{ip:volete}",
              "{ip:dovete}"
            ],
            [
              "loro",
              "{ip:possono}",
              "{ip:vogliono}",
              "{ip:devono}"
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "To talk about the near future, Italian often uses simply the present: *Domani {ip:parto}*. You can also use two expressions.",
      {
        "table": {
          "head": [
            "Form",
            "Meaning",
            "Example"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "andare a + infinitive",
              "going somewhere to do something",
              "{ip:Vado} a mangiare."
            ],
            [
              "stare per + infinitive",
              "about to do something",
              "{ip:Sto} per uscire."
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "Commands depend on whom you are speaking to.",
      {
        "table": {
          "head": [
            "",
            "-are",
            "-ere",
            "-ire"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "tu",
              "{imv:guard**a**}! {imv:scus**a**}!",
              "{imv:prend**i**}!",
              "{imv:sent**i**}!"
            ],
            [
              "Lei (polite)",
              "{imv:guard**i**}! {imv:scus**i**}!",
              "{imv:prend**a**}!",
              "{imv:sent**a**}!"
            ],
            [
              "voi",
              "{imv:guard**ate**}!",
              "{imv:prend**ete**}!",
              "{imv:sent**ite**}!"
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "A negative command with *tu* uses *non + infinitive*: *Non parlare!*"
    ]
  },
  "use": {
    "exercises": [
      {
        "type": "gap",
        "prompt": "Put the verb in brackets in the right form.",
        "questions": [
          "[[Posso#ip]] entrare? (potere, io)",
          "Tu [[vuoi#ip]] un caffè? (volere)",
          "Marco [[deve#ip]] lavorare. (dovere)",
          "Noi [[possiamo#ip]] venire. (potere)",
          "Voi [[volete#ip]] mangiare? (volere)",
          "Loro [[devono#ip]] partire. (dovere)",
          "Noi [[dobbiamo#ip]] studiare. (dovere)"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "choice",
        "prompt": "Choose the right form.",
        "questions": [
          {
            "q": "Il film ___ per cominciare. (it's about to start)",
            "options": [
              "{ip:va}",
              "*{ip:sta}",
              "{ip:è}"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "{ip:Vado} ___ dormire.",
            "options": [
              "*a",
              "per",
              "di"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "Excuse me, sir! (polite)",
            "options": [
              "{imv:Scusa}!",
              "*{imv:Scusi}!",
              "{imv:Scusate}!"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "Look! (to a friend)",
            "options": [
              "*{imv:Guarda}!",
              "{imv:Guardi}!",
              "{ip:Guardano}!"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "Take the bus! (polite)",
            "options": [
              "{imv:Prendi} l'autobus!",
              "*{imv:Prenda} l'autobus!",
              "{ip:Prende} l'autobus!"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "Don't speak! (to a friend)",
            "options": [
              "Non {imv:parli}!",
              "*Non parlare!",
              "Non {imv:parla}!"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
